<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Hi&nbsp; Christian<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please help to review this patch. The whole story is=
 as follows<span lang=3D"ZH-CN" style=3D"font-family:=CB=CE=CC=E5">=A3=BA</=
span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">For pass-through case, amdgpu module driver may be i=
ncluded into one image with specified BDF parameter,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">which will cause the failure of virtual display crea=
tion when the slot where GPU is put into is modified.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Therefore adding the new parameter =A1=B0all=A1=B1 f=
or virtual display enable will fix this issue. Thanks a lot.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Best Regards<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Yintian Tao<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
